{"author":{"id":"6c7374a500bfd4cb191ae45b3f9d4b7a3d9d7f0324d04add217e8cbefeb7e1b9"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1792263018,"nonce":"NCz4zeFJLvXRoysitpcIhAIiWZg=","title":"Text in a rounded clip that an outer clip cuts is not drawn with newer blinc_abi","message":"**What**\n\nWith blinc_abi at or after a65b3a6 (\"Clip in the record's space a rounded clip that others cut\"), text inside a rounded overflow-hidden box that an outer clip also cuts is not drawn: the box and its background draw, its glyphs do not. Text in a rounded clip nothing else cuts, and plain text, still draw. ashui's main drew no text in ChimpMonk's editor at 3cf0c94 and 992beda, which moved the pin from d26858b to 17a1260 and took that commit and others with it; at 5007496 it did.\n\n**Reproducer**\n\nA scene with an outer box (overflow: hidden, border-radius: 24px, 260 by 110) holding a wider inner box (overflow: hidden, border-radius: 16px) with two lines of text. At d26858b both lines draw; at 17a1260 neither does. tests/fixtures/render/NestedClipTextPixels.hx checks it by pixels (run.sh render).\n\n**Cause**\n\na65b3a6 makes the innermost rounded clip the record's local clip when the clips outside it cut it, and leaves the outer clips on the screen. ashui's glyph pass takes no local clip, so a glyph record that carries one is clipped away. The other record kinds that commit names (box, image, backdrop) are not reproduced yet.\n\n**Now**\n\nashui pins blinc_abi to a branch of d26858b with only the font commits (Register bundled fonts, system face on wasm), so it does not take a65b3a6, f5067ee or the rest of blinc_abi main.\n\n**To do**\n\nTeach the glyph pass, and any other pass whose shader takes no local clip, to apply a record's local clip, then move the pin to blinc_abi main. Until then no pin may include a65b3a6.","files":null}]}